{"unit_id":"baobaolaodie__cc-dsh-notifier#card-zh","repo":"baobaolaodie/cc-dsh-notifier","commit":"8f93b37759d6a057062c4f1c2abce1ec6a6bd61d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"cc-dsh-notifier（DSH 插件，Web 和 TUI 客户端）：为 Windows 上的 DeepSeek Harness 会话提供原生桌面提醒。插件订阅会话及交互事件，将提醒转发到本机通知守护进程，并按 Web 浏览器或终端会话绑定窗口。主要功能包括权限请求和问题提醒、等待输入时通知、目标窗口聚焦时抑制通知，以及点击 Toast 返回对应会话。适合希望离开 DSH 窗口时仍能收到提醒的 Windows 用户。需要 Windows 10/11、Node.js 18+、Python 3 和 winrt 通知组件。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/dsh-notifier/lib/index.js:25-37","plugins/dsh-notifier/lib/payload.mjs:33-82","plugins/dsh-notifier/lib/runtime/lib/daemon-core.mjs:77-85"]}
{"unit_id":"baobaolaodie__cc-dsh-notifier#card-en","repo":"baobaolaodie/cc-dsh-notifier","commit":"8f93b37759d6a057062c4f1c2abce1ec6a6bd61d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"cc-dsh-notifier (DSH Web/TUI plugin) sends Windows desktop alerts for permission requests, questions, and sessions waiting for input. It suppresses alerts while the session window is focused and returns to the session when a toast is clicked. Requires Windows 10/11, Node.js 18+, Python 3, and WinRT.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/dsh-notifier/lib/index.js:25-37","plugins/dsh-notifier/lib/payload.mjs:33-82","plugins/dsh-notifier/lib/runtime/lib/daemon-core.mjs:77-85"]}
